  "title": "AGTTM Part 5 - Short Term Low Impact Worksites",
  "abstract": "AGTTM Part 5 provides simplified traffic management requirements for short-term and low-impact worksites in Australia and New Zealand. The standard establishes criteria for qualifying as short-term low-impact work based on work duration, traffic impact assessment, and road environment characteristics. It enables reduced traffic management protocols while maintaining equivalent safety outcomes, applying to activities such as minor road repairs, pothole patching, sign installation, and utility inspections.",
